  "body": "To download the property documents use the following link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/G2SQ\r\n\r\nA little bit quirky, a little bit unexpected and a whole lot of fun. Welcome to 234 Hillcrest Road, where luxury meets personality and grown-up living feels like an adventure.\r\n\r\nPerched high above a spectacular canopy of native bush, this is the ultimate luxury treehouse. A home that makes you feel like you're on top of the world, with breathtaking views, magical sunrises, spectacular sunsets and nothing but sky, treetops and birdsong surrounding you. It's hard to believe you're just minutes from Orewa.\r\n\r\nFunky, functional and full of character, this single-level home makes the absolute most of its incredible setting. Soaring pitched ceilings, beautiful flooring and windows everywhere you look flood the open-plan living spaces with natural light, yet the surrounding bush provides a wonderful sense of privacy. A woodburner adds warmth and atmosphere, while the funky kitchen brings its own personality to the heart of the home.\r\n\r\nExpansive stacker sliders open the living areas right up, blurring the lines between inside and out. One moment you're relaxing in the lounge, the next you're amongst the treetops, with the bush becoming an extension of your living space. It's a pretty special way to live.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms are positioned off an oversized hallway, providing separation from the main living areas. There's also a double garage with substantial storage above, accessed by a ladder, plus excellent off-street parking for the adventure toys.\r\n\r\nBut just when you think you've seen it all, this property has a few more surprises up its sleeve.\r\n\r\nTucked near the home is a cute standalone cabin, ideal as a home office, hobby room or extra sleepover space. And then there's the real showstopper.\r\n\r\nYour very own bespoke outdoor container bar.\r\n\r\nA little like a Transformer, the side opens right up to reveal an incredible entertaining space with a stunning bush vista of its own. Complete with built-in seating, lighting, a fridge, plumbed sink and pizza oven, it's equipped for long afternoons that turn into even longer evenings. No need to head back to the house, everything you need is right here. Add the freestanding vinyl pool and you've got yourself the ultimate adults' playground. This is party central, with a view!\r\n\r\nAnd while it feels like you've escaped to the middle of nowhere, Orewa's cafés, restaurants, shops and amenities are just minutes away, with Hatfields Beach and the beautiful Mahurangi Peninsula close by for boating, beach days and weekend adventures.\r\n\r\nThis isn't your typical lifestyle property. It's a home with attitude, individuality and an undeniable sense of fun. Somewhere to entertain, unwind, escape the everyday and enjoy life from a completely different perspective.\r\n\r\nA little wild, wonderfully private and seriously cool. Once you're up here, you might never want to come down.",
